    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d171">

                <pb facs="0171" n="165" xml:id="pg165"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-04"><hi rendition="#italic">April 4,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Bill which passed Senate yesterday contains nothing but provisions for
                    enforcement of regulations. House committee unanimously instructed its chairman
                    to move suspension of rules and pass bill immediately. At all events, bill will
                    be a law this week.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
